# Environment files
# .env, .env.dev, .env.test and .env.local.example ARE committed: defaults only, no secrets.
# Real values and secrets go in the files below, which are never committed:
#   .env.local          (all environments)
#   .env.<env>.local    (e.g. .env.test.local)
# (/.env.local, /.env.local.php and /.env.*.local are already ignored by the Symfony block above.)
# Production secrets: environment variables or the Symfony secrets vault (bin/console secrets:set).
